Issue 1:
ng : File C:\Users\TeamS\AppData\Roaming\npm\ng.ps1 cannot be loaded because running scripts is disabled on this system. 
For more information, see about_Execution_Policies at https:/go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkID=135170. At line:1 char:1 + ng serve + ~~ + CategoryInfo :
SecurityError: (:) [], PSSecurityException + FullyQualifiedErrorId : UnauthorizedAccess

Solution: 
# In the same PowerShell window
Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope Process -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -Force
ng serve

# run PowerShell as admin just once
Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope CurrentUser -ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned
# for a single session only, you can also do:
# Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope Process -ExecutionPolicy Bypass
